- Bindings: `item`, `base`, `surcharge`, `item.cursed`, `base`(×2), `CURSE_SURCHARGE_RATE`, `HIGH_ENCHANTMENT_SURCHARGE_RATE`, `surcharge`(return) ≈ 9 = 9
